<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <meta name="description" content="Pixie is a craft-led theatre studio for actors, young performers, directors, and curious beginners.">
    <title>Pixie Theatre Studio | The Green Room Portal</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/fonts/fonts.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="styles.css">
  </head>
  <body>
    <a class="skip-link" href="#main">Skip to content</a>

    <header class="site-header" aria-label="Primary">
      <a class="brand" href="#top" aria-label="Pixie home">
        <span class="brand-mark" aria-hidden="true">P</span>
        <span>
          <strong>Pixie</strong>
          <small>Theatre Studio</small>
        </span>
      </a>
      <nav class="nav-links" aria-label="Page sections">
        <a href="#pathways">Pathways</a>
        <a href="#method">Method</a>
        <a href="#join">Join</a>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <main id="main">
      <section class="hero" id="top" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
        <div class="hero-copy">
          <p class="eyebrow">The Green Room Portal</p>
          <h1 id="hero-title">Step into the room where performances become possible.</h1>
          <p class="hero-lede">Pixie is a theatre studio for actors, young performers, directors, and curious beginners, building voice, movement, ensemble, and stage confidence through craft-led training.</p>
          <div class="hero-actions" aria-label="Hero calls to action">
            <a class="button button-primary" href="#call-sheet">Book a workshop</a>
            <a class="button button-secondary" href="#pathways">See studio pathways</a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="portal-wrap" aria-label="The Pixie Portal rehearsal stage">
          <div class="portal-stage">
            <div class="stage-haze" aria-hidden="true"></div>
            <div class="back-wall" aria-hidden="true">
              <span class="cue-light cue-light-a"></span>
              <span class="cue-light cue-light-b"></span>
              <span class="mirror-line mirror-line-a"></span>
              <span class="mirror-line mirror-line-b"></span>
            </div>
            <div class="portal-door" aria-hidden="true">
              <span class="door-glow"></span>
              <span class="door-curtain left"></span>
              <span class="door-curtain right"></span>
              <span class="doorway"></span>
              <span class="lantern"></span>
            </div>
            <div class="floor-grid" aria-hidden="true">
              <span class="tape tape-one"></span>
              <span class="tape tape-two"></span>
              <span class="tape tape-three"></span>
              <span class="floor-mark mark-a"></span>
              <span class="floor-mark mark-b"></span>
              <span class="floor-mark mark-c"></span>
              <span class="floor-mark mark-d"></span>
            </div>
            <div class="cue-card card-voice">
              <small>01</small>
              <strong>Voice</strong>
            </div>
            <div class="cue-card card-movement">
              <small>02</small>
              <strong>Movement</strong>
            </div>
            <div class="cue-card card-scene">
              <small>03</small>
              <strong>Scene Work</strong>
            </div>
            <div class="cue-card card-devising">
              <small>04</small>
              <strong>Devising</strong>
            </div>
            <div class="cue-card card-showcase">
              <small>05</small>
              <strong>Showcase</strong>
            </div>
            <div class="script-scrap scrap-one" aria-hidden="true">enter on breath</div>
            <div class="script-scrap scrap-two" aria-hidden="true">hold the room</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section notes-section" aria-labelledby="why-title">
        <div class="section-intro pinned">
          <p class="eyebrow">Why Pixie Exists</p>
          <h2 id="why-title">Magic is rehearsal made visible.</h2>
          <p>Pixie is not star-making hype. It is a working room for people who want to perform with more courage, clarity, and craft. Bring a speech, a question, or just your nerves. We work in the room, not in theory.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="principles" aria-label="Pixie principles">
          <article class="note-card note-tilt-left">
            <span class="pin" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            <p class="cue-number">Principle 01</p>
            <h3>Play with rigor</h3>
            <p>Games, improvisation, and discovery are held with precision: breath, timing, listening, repeatable choices.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="note-card note-tilt-right">
            <span class="pin" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            <p class="cue-number">Principle 02</p>
            <h3>Find the body before the line</h3>
            <p>Before text becomes polished, performers learn where impulse, posture, rhythm, and attention live.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="note-card">
            <span class="pin" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            <p class="cue-number">Principle 03</p>
            <h3>Make the room brave enough to fail in</h3>
            <p>Confidence grows through ensemble discipline, generous notes, and the strange magic of trying again.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section pathways-section" id="pathways" aria-labelledby="pathways-title">
        <div class="section-heading">
          <p class="eyebrow">What Happens Here</p>
          <h2 id="pathways-title">Four notices on the call-board.</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="call-board">
          <article class="notice">
            <p class="cue-number">Casting Room A</p>
            <h3>Actor Training</h3>
            <p>Voice, movement, text, improvisation, and scene partnership for adults and emerging performers.</p>
            <span>Weekly evening rooms with practical notes and repeatable exercises.</span>
          </article>
          <article class="notice">
            <p class="cue-number">Studio Term</p>
            <h3>Youth Theatre Studio</h3>
            <p>Confidence, ensemble, storytelling, and showcase terms for young performers learning the craft.</p>
            <span>Age-aware groups with end-of-block sharing for invited audiences.</span>
          </article>
          <article class="notice">
            <p class="cue-number">Short Calls</p>
            <h3>Workshops &amp; Intensives</h3>
            <p>Audition prep, monologues, devised theatre, physical theatre, and scene refreshers.</p>
            <span>One-off sessions and weekend intensives for specific performance muscles.</span>
          </article>
          <article class="notice">
            <p class="cue-number">Black-Box Lab</p>
            <h3>Production Lab</h3>
            <p>Small staged works, scratch nights, and studio showcases built from rehearsal outward.</p>
            <span>For performers ready to move from practice room to showing.</span>
          </article>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section method-section" id="method" aria-labelledby="method-title">
        <div class="section-heading">
          <p class="eyebrow">The Rehearsal Method</p>
          <h2 id="method-title">From spark to stage, one cue at a time.</h2>
        </div>
        <ol class="method-strip">
          <li><span>01</span><strong>Warm-up</strong></li>
          <li><span>02</span><strong>Ensemble</strong></li>
          <li><span>03</span><strong>Text / Body</strong></li>
          <li><span>04</span><strong>Scene Build</strong></li>
          <li><span>05</span><strong>Notes</strong></li>
          <li><span>06</span><strong>Showing</strong></li>
        </ol>
        <div class="proof-line" aria-label="Operating model">
          <span>Small groups</span>
          <span>Working-room feedback</span>
          <span>Showcase-ready outcomes</span>
          <span>Beginner-safe, craft-serious</span>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section atmosphere-section" aria-labelledby="atmosphere-title">
        <div class="section-heading">
          <p class="eyebrow">Studio Atmosphere</p>
          <h2 id="atmosphere-title">Warm light, sharp notes, no velvet-rope mystery.</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="atmosphere-grid">
          <article class="studio-panel rehearsal-circle">
            <div class="panel-art">
              <img src="assets/theatre_actors_in_rehearsal_circle_doing_physical_warmup_candid_studio_workshop_warm_low_light.jpg" alt="Actors warming up in a theatre rehearsal circle.">
            </div>
            <h3>Rehearsal Circle</h3>
            <p>Bodies awake, breath in the room, everyone visible before anyone has to be impressive.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="quote-block">
            <p>“I came for confidence; I left understanding how to listen on stage.”</p>
          </article>
          <article class="studio-panel table-work">
            <div class="panel-art">
              <img src="assets/close_up_of_scripts_rehearsal_notes_pencils_and_hands_on_a_theatre_table_natural_warm_light.webp" alt="Scripts, rehearsal notes, pencils, and hands on a warm theatre table.">
            </div>
            <h3>Script &amp; Table Work</h3>
            <p>Pencils down, questions up, choices tested before they are performed.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="studio-panel performance-night">
            <div class="panel-art">
              <img src="assets/intimate_black_box_studio_performance_small_ensemble_on_stage_dramatic_side_lighting_audience_barely_visible.jpg" alt="Small ensemble performing in an intimate black-box studio.">
            </div>
            <h3>Showing Night</h3>
            <p>The work meets a small audience without losing the scale and honesty of the room.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="quote-block blush">
            <p>“The room feels playful, but the notes are precise.”</p>
          </article>
        </div>
        <div class="metrics" aria-label="Studio metrics">
          <div><strong>8-14</strong><span>person workshop rooms</span></div>
          <div><strong>6</strong><span>week studio blocks</span></div>
          <div><strong>End-of-term</strong><span>sharing nights</span></div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section join-section" id="join" aria-labelledby="join-title">
        <div class="section-heading">
          <p class="eyebrow">Join the Room</p>
          <h2 id="join-title">Choose the call that fits your next rehearsal.</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="offers">
          <article class="offer">
            <p class="cue-number">Low-friction first call</p>
            <h3>Taster Workshop</h3>
            <p>One evening in the Pixie room. Bring a speech, a question, or just your nerves.</p>
            <strong>Request current dates &amp; fees</strong>
          </article>
          <article class="offer featured">
            <p class="cue-number">Core pathway</p>
            <h3>Studio Block</h3>
            <p>Six weeks of scene, voice, and ensemble work, with feedback that belongs in the body.</p>
            <strong>From term blocks</strong>
          </article>
          <article class="offer">
            <p class="cue-number">Toward a showing</p>
            <h3>Production Lab</h3>
            <p>For performers ready to build toward scratch nights, studio showcases, and small staged work.</p>
            <strong>By application or invitation</strong>
          </article>
        </div>

        <div class="signup" id="call-sheet">
          <div>
            <p class="eyebrow">Stage Manager's Sign-In</p>
            <h2>Put your name on the call sheet.</h2>
            <p>A studio for people who want to perform with more courage, clarity, and craft.</p>
          </div>
          <form class="call-sheet" action="#" method="post">
            <label for="name">Name</label>
            <input id="name" name="name" type="text" autocomplete="name" required>

            <label for="email">Email</label>
            <input id="email" name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" required>

            <label for="interest">Interest</label>
            <select id="interest" name="interest" required>
              <option value="">Choose a pathway</option>
              <option>Taster Workshop</option>
              <option>Studio Block</option>
              <option>Youth Theatre Studio</option>
              <option>Production Lab</option>
            </select>

            <label for="message">Message <span>(optional)</span></label>
            <textarea id="message" name="message" rows="4"></textarea>

            <button class="button button-primary" type="submit">Put my name on the call sheet</button>
            <p class="form-note" aria-live="polite">We will reply with current dates, room size, and what to bring.</p>
          </form>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>

    <footer class="site-footer">
      <p>Pixie Theatre Studio</p>
      <p>Warm light. Sharp notes. Try again.</p>
    </footer>

    <script src="assets/vendor/gsap.min.js"></script>
    <script src="assets/vendor/ScrollTrigger.min.js"></script>
    <script src="script.js"></script>
  </body>
</html>
